@{
    ViewBag.Title = "About";
}
<main aria-labelledby="title">
    <h2 id="title">About Donaldson Mottors:</h2>
    <h3>Learn a little bit about us...</h3>


    @*<a href="@Url.Action("SMStest", "Home")" class="btn btn-primary">
        Test SMS
    </a> failed*@
    <section>
        <p>
            Welcome to <strong>Donalson Motors</strong>, a trusted, family-run garage proudly serving Glasgow for over
            <strong>55 years</strong>. Built on a foundation of honesty, reliability, and skilled workmanship, we have been
            keeping local drivers safely on the road for generations.
        </p>

        <p>
            Over the decades, we’ve grown from a small neighbourhood workshop into a well-established name in vehicle
            servicing and repairs, while still maintaining the personal touch and friendly service our customers have come to expect.
        </p>

        <p>
            At Donalson Motors, we believe in doing things properly. Whether it’s a routine service or a more complex mechanical repair,
            our experienced technicians take pride in delivering high-quality workmanship at fair and transparent prices. We work on all
            makes and models, ensuring every vehicle receives the same level of care and attention.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>What We Do</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>Vehicle servicing (interim and full services)</li>
            <li>Mechanical repairs</li>
            <li>Engine diagnostics</li>
            <li>Brake, clutch, and exhaust repairs</li>
            <li>General maintenance and safety checks</li>
        </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>Our Promise</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>Honest advice you can trust</li>
            <li>Clear communication before any work begins</li>
            <li>Quality repairs done right the first time</li>
            <li>A friendly, local service you can rely on</li>
        </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>Why Choose Us?</h2>
        <p>
            At Donalson Motors, many of our customers have stayed with us for years—some even for generations.
            We’re proud of the reputation we’ve built in Glasgow as a dependable garage that puts customers first.
        </p>

        <p>
            Whether you’re booking in for a quick service or need help diagnosing a problem, you can count on Donalson Motors
            to keep your vehicle running smoothly.
        </p>
    </section>
</main>